# Exclude everything not needed by the Docker build context.
# The shards (Ornith-1.0-35B-Q4_K_M-*.gguf, Qwen3.5-0.8B.Q4_K_M-*.gguf)
# are placed in the working directory by CI before docker build runs,
# so we keep them via the explicit !include patterns below.
*
!*.gguf
!Dockerfile
!Dockerfile.in
!models/
!models/**

# Explicit shard patterns (defensive; CI generates Dockerfile referencing
# these exact basenames).
!Ornith-1.0-35B-Q4_K_M-*.gguf
!Qwen3.5-0.8B.Q4_K_M-*.gguf